WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.462 --> 00:00:03.395
Lesson ten. Simple Science!

2
00:00:04.294 --> 00:00:11.644
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.613 --> 00:00:15.390
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.441 --> 00:00:18.700
Today we learn: Simple Science! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:23.224
Water! Say it with me. Water!

6
00:00:27.136 --> 00:00:30.636
Air! Say it with me. Air!

7
00:00:34.593 --> 00:00:38.176
Fire! Say it with me. Fire!

8
00:00:42.183 --> 00:00:45.750
Earth! Say it with me. Earth!

9
00:00:49.776 --> 00:00:53.376
Ice! Say it with me. Ice!

10
00:00:57.325 --> 00:01:01.008
Steam! Say it with me. Steam!

11
00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:08.537
Light! Say it with me. Light!

12
00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:15.951
Sound! Say it with me. Sound!

13
00:01:20.004 --> 00:01:25.840
Listen. When it is cold, water becomes ice.

14
00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:30.239
Say it with me. When it is cold, water becomes ice.

15
00:01:35.192 --> 00:01:41.841
Water can turn into ice when it is cold, and into steam when it is hot. Light and sound travel fast.

16
00:01:41.891 --> 00:01:43.234
I like this story!

17
00:01:44.114 --> 00:01:49.455
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.505 --> 00:01:50.655
Fire!

19
00:01:51.617 --> 00:01:56.879
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:56.929 --> 00:01:58.079
Steam!

21
00:01:58.914 --> 00:02:04.914
Value corner: Courage. Being brave means trying new things even when we feel scared.

22
00:02:04.964 --> 00:02:06.648
I can show courage too!

23
00:02:07.457 --> 00:02:14.681
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:14.731 --> 00:02:16.479
Bye-bye, friends!

